fields.description:
Rewrite bead as a Rust Cargo workspace. Format 1, the bytes of the store and of the published tree, the CLI contract and every decision in REVIEWING.md §2 stay exactly as they are. Port every test, and move pancake-studio onto beadroll-core. The plan is docs/RUST-PORT.md (commit 492b916); the per-test port catalogues are in docs/rust-port/.

Parity first: behaviour changes wait until after the cutover (docs/RUST-PORT.md §1).

Decisions of 2026-10-09 (docs/RUST-PORT.md §10):
- the port lives in this repository;
- failpoints in every build;
- reject non-finite numbers and ids with a trailing newline;
- no public release: every crate has publish = false and machines install from source;
- MSRV 1.99.

The children follow the plan's phases. Phase 3, the test port, can start as soon as Phase 0 lands, because ported tests are first run against the Python binary.
